{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "semi-dark-orange",
        "name": "Catalyst deploys (PR merged)",
        "target": {
          "expr": "{service_name=\"catalyst.github\"} |= `merged`",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "deploys"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "id": null,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Catalyst \u00b7 Fleet \u00b7 Updater \u2014 plugin-pull freshness\n\nMonitors the **catalyst.updater** git plugin-pull daemon (OTL-38 / CTL-1350). Each refresh emits one pino line (`updater: refresh`) on `service_name=catalyst.updater`; the collector promotes its fields into `catalyst_updater_refresh_*` metrics, and `plugin.checkout.*` / `node.updater.heartbeat` events flow to Loki.\n\n**Ships ready-to-receive.** The updater metrics and install signals are **inert until adoption** (and the install PR2). Until the first refresh + first heartbeat land, panels read **empty / `No data yet` / `0`** \u2014 that is expected, not a fault. The version Gantt is **interim** (state-timeline off `catalyst_build_info`); an event-sourced version timeline off `plugin.checkout.updated` is a follow-up."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "p95 plugin-pull refresh wall time over the last 1h, across all reasons/hosts. Lights up on first adoption.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "No data yet",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 15
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(catalyst_updater_refresh_duration_seconds_bucket[1h])))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "title": "Refresh p95 (1h)"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Plugin-checkout failures summed across all refreshes in the last 1h. Any value > 0 means a pull is in trouble.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(catalyst_updater_refresh_failed_total[1h])) or vector(0)",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "title": "Failed checkouts (1h)"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Plugin checkouts pulled (fetched) summed across all refreshes in the last 1h \u2014 the work the updater actually did.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(catalyst_updater_refresh_pulled_total[1h])) or vector(0)",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
